# Settings ▸ Advanced "When opening Cra, start on a new tab" (X DM 7 Nov 2026, not in Arc): after a
# relaunch the window keeps its tabs but selects none, loads no page, and has the command bar open
# for a new tab, as ⌘T. Off (Arc's way, LaunchStartTests) it opens on the tab in use last.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false, "startOnNewTab": true}
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=last
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://debug?browserWindows=before
expect-log browser windows before: kind=normal listed=1 tabs=1 open=1 commandBar=0 pages=1
relaunch
wait 4
cra://debug?browserWindows=after
# cra.log, which the relaunched Cra writes to (its NSLog lines aren't kept).
expect-log browser windows after: kind=normal listed=1 tabs=1 open=0 commandBar=1 pages=0
